  "label": "User projected onto the Shiba Inu dog's skeptical expression",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the Shiba Inu dog (VisualMaterial) as the embodiment of disbelief or challenge toward the text. The dog's skeptical expression is culturally understood to represent the user's own questioning stance, making the user identify with the dog's reaction to the text's message about humor standards. This projection is implicit, as the meme format relies on the user recognizing the dog's expression as a proxy for their own skepticism or challenge.",
